{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分大字变成包含多层因果和转折的长句，第一眼定位核心落点不如X利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最大的提升，是把原来藏在小字里的关键动机、心理依据和情绪转折搬进了大字，普通观众不必依赖小字，就能明白他为什么放松、退缩、孤单、重新期待，以及为什么又害怕失去。S05到S14尤其明显，人物的心理变化不再只是一个个情绪标签，而是有前因、有反应、有矛盾、有回转的连续过程，细腻度也更充分。X的短句更利于扫读，但部分关键心理依据容易被忽略；综合观看体验，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bf114b41-b64a-4bca-a312-202d1e7cd2f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T191139318363Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:12:56.746436+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "627923313cec00af937067d336f22b6e57ba2ebb25e675a11038ddfdd555e35e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":